This plugin is a port of FakeProfileThemes to Valenced.

Original Vendetta plugin: FakeProfileThemesAndEffects by ryan
Source: https://github.com/ryan-0324/vendetta-plugins/tree/main/plugins/FakeProfileThemesAndEffects
License: CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/)

The 3y3 color format was introduced by the FakeProfileThemes plugin for Vencord by
Alyxia Sother and Remty.
Source: https://github.com/Vendicated/Vencord/tree/main/src/plugins/fakeProfileThemes

This port only implements the legacy `[#rrggbb,#rrggbb]` color format, so bios
written by Vencord, Vendetta and Revenge FakeProfileThemes users stay compatible.
